{"html":"<p>Financial systems fail differently from other systems: the failure is silent,\nretroactive, and measured in money. That changes what you want from a language.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-the-domain-demands\">What the domain demands</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Requirement</th>\n<th>What it forces</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Exact arithmetic</td>\n<td>Integer minor units, never floats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>No silent overflow</td>\n<td>An overflow that wraps is a wrong balance</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Auditable failure</td>\n<td>Every rejection has a typed reason, not a string</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Determinism</td>\n<td>The same input must produce the same output, in tests and in production</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Long-lived correctness</td>\n<td>Code outlives the team that wrote it</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Rust's contribution here is not speed. It is that the type system can be made to\ncarry the rules — and that a whole class of \"it compiled, so it shipped\" bugs\nbecomes impossible.</p>\n<h2 id=\"who-runs-it\">Who runs it</h2>\n<p>Payments is a domain where companies talk less than infrastructure vendors do, so\npublic case studies are rarer. What is well documented:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Kraken</strong> publicly rewrote exchange services in Rust, citing correctness under\nconcurrency.</li>\n<li><strong>Stripe, Mercado Libre and others</strong> have published Rust in internal tooling and\nservices; most payment processors now run <em>some</em> Rust in the hot path even where\nthe public surface is not Rust.</li>\n<li>The strongest evidence is structural: <strong>double-entry ledgers, idempotency keys\nand typed money</strong> are all things the Rust ecosystem has standardised crates for\n(<code>rust_decimal</code>, <code>money</code>, <code>uuid</code>, <code>serde</code>).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If you are evaluating Rust for a payment system, the question is not \"who uses\nit\" but \"does it make the wrong state unrepresentable\". It does, better than most.</p>\n<h2 id=\"make-illegal-states-unrepresentable\">Make illegal states unrepresentable</h2>\n<p>Start with money. A <code>f64</code> balance is a defect, not a style choice.</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\"><code data-language=\"rust\" data-theme=\"github-light github-dark-dimmed\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">/// Amount in paise. The type is the unit — you cannot add a `Paise` to an `i64`</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#768390\">/// by accident, and you cannot accidentally store rupees.</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">#[derive(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Debug</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Clone</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Copy</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">PartialEq</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Eq</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">PartialOrd</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Ord</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, serde</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Serialize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">, serde</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">::</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">Deserialize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">)]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">#[serde(transparent)]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> struct</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Paise</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\">i64</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">impl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Paise</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\"> {</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> const</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\"> ZERO</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">:</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#F69D50\"> Paise</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\"> =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#DCBDFB\"> Paise</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#6CB6FF\">0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#ADBAC7\">);</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F47067\">    pub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#